1
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,000
[EP10]

2
00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:46,900
Why are you mad?

3
00:00:48,360 --> 00:00:49,460
Chu Nanfeng has already left.

4
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:51,520
This trick doesn't work on me.

5
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:52,920
I hope it doesn't.

6
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:54,700
What you know

7
00:00:54,820 --> 00:00:56,300
is that your arm is injured.

8
00:00:56,520 --> 00:00:57,520
What you don't know

9
00:01:00,260 --> 00:01:01,300
is that you're weak.

10
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:12,180
Do you like

11
00:01:13,220 --> 00:01:13,940
the wild grass outside so much?

12
00:01:15,040 --> 00:01:16,100
Is Chu Nanfeng's car

13
00:01:16,820 --> 00:01:17,740
that comfortable?

14
00:01:18,580 --> 00:01:19,680
I'd rather take his car

15
00:01:20,100 --> 00:01:20,920
than yours.

16
00:01:36,720 --> 00:01:37,480
I can do it myself.

17
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:38,960
Don't move.

18
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:50,580
It hurts.

19
00:02:08,200 --> 00:02:09,100
Chu Nanfeng...

20
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:17,160
He's so mean.

21
00:02:22,900 --> 00:02:23,880
It's badly swollen.

22
00:02:25,140 --> 00:02:26,880
You'd better not meet anyone for a few days.

23
00:02:29,320 --> 00:02:29,740
Young Marshal.

24
00:02:36,180 --> 00:02:36,860
Who is he?

25
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:38,580
Commander Ling.

26
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:42,980
Young Madam.

27
00:02:43,260 --> 00:02:44,240
The Old Marshal just got back.

28
00:02:44,600 --> 00:02:45,540
He's still weak, I'll take him to bed.

29
00:02:45,540 --> 00:02:45,900
Wait.

30
00:02:49,260 --> 00:02:50,180
Mr. Chu Nanfeng

31
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,260
sent this gift

32
00:02:52,160 --> 00:02:53,160
to express his regards.

33
00:03:10,320 --> 00:03:11,000
What's the hurry?

34
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:13,800
If so,

35
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:15,700
please send me back first.

36
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:20,720
You will

37
00:03:22,320 --> 00:03:23,180
stay here tonight.

38
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:35,900
When we met the Old Marshal today,

39
00:03:36,320 --> 00:03:38,100
Ling Shenxing was obviously nervous.

40
00:03:38,740 --> 00:03:40,160
And his fingers have no calluses,

41
00:03:40,480 --> 00:03:42,060
not like a gun holder for years.

42
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:43,740
Or

43
00:03:44,180 --> 00:03:45,240
he's not the real Old Marshal?

44
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:48,740
What's Ling Shenxing hiding?

45
00:03:51,860 --> 00:03:52,720
I'm useless.

46
00:03:53,020 --> 00:03:54,060
I didn't expect

47
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:55,000
you to see your uncle.

48
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:57,160
There's no uncle in this house.

49
00:03:58,100 --> 00:03:59,060
Only Commander Ling.

50
00:03:59,100 --> 00:03:59,580
Yes.

51
00:04:02,780 --> 00:04:03,760
A gift

52
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:05,220
from Mr. Chu Nanfeng.

53
00:04:07,580 --> 00:04:08,480
Chu Nanfeng

54
00:04:09,440 --> 00:04:11,160
should have found out my father is an impostor.

55
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:12,360
Do as planned.

56
00:04:12,660 --> 00:04:13,940
Let the identity of my uncle disappear.

57
00:04:14,020 --> 00:04:14,260
Yes,

58
00:04:14,820 --> 00:04:15,380
I understand.

59
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:29,340
What are you laughing at?

60
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:30,920
I'm laughing

61
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:32,560
that you finally

62
00:04:32,860 --> 00:04:35,160
become a real couple with the Young Marshal.

63
00:04:35,940 --> 00:04:36,640
Tonight,

64
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:37,600
do your best.

65
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:38,680
How about

66
00:04:38,860 --> 00:04:40,080
I prepare for you?

67
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:42,200
It's a good thing.

68
00:04:42,640 --> 00:04:43,100
Do you want it or not?

69
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:49,900
Have you heard about the Young Marshal's request?

70
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:50,800
Yes.

71
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:51,540
The whole mansion

72
00:04:51,640 --> 00:04:52,980
has heard about it.

73
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:54,140
The Young Marshal

74
00:04:54,220 --> 00:04:55,640
finally accepted the Young Madam.

75
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:56,080
Humph!

76
00:04:56,940 --> 00:04:57,840
I know

77
00:04:58,040 --> 00:04:58,960
the truth.

78
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:00,580
Young Madam

79
00:05:00,840 --> 00:05:01,860
put that kind of drug

80
00:05:01,960 --> 00:05:03,000
in Young Marshal's tea.

81
00:05:03,200 --> 00:05:03,840
What kind of drug?

82
00:05:04,700 --> 00:05:06,000
It's to make men...

83
00:05:08,400 --> 00:05:09,240
Young Madam,

84
00:05:10,320 --> 00:05:11,520
I'm just a nobody

85
00:05:11,860 --> 00:05:12,820
in this Ling residence.

86
00:05:13,200 --> 00:05:14,000
I'm afraid I can't

87
00:05:14,020 --> 00:05:16,080
be your respectful servant.

88
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:17,380
I dare not.

89
00:05:17,520 --> 00:05:18,500
My Lady, please forgive me.

90
00:05:18,880 --> 00:05:19,940
I was just talking nonsense.

91
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:20,980
I'm so sorry.

92
00:05:24,400 --> 00:05:25,120
I'll punish myself.

93
00:05:25,580 --> 00:05:26,360
I'm so sorry.

94
00:05:26,700 --> 00:05:27,320
Doukou,

95
00:05:27,980 --> 00:05:28,940
are you acting?

96
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:32,200
You do it.

97
00:05:32,940 --> 00:05:33,660
Twenty times.

98
00:05:34,660 --> 00:05:35,640
Every slap

99
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:36,760
should be loud enough

100
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:38,240
so that everyone outside

101
00:05:38,700 --> 00:05:39,240
can hear it clearly.

102
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:45,340
Ah.

103
00:05:45,860 --> 00:05:46,920
If there's even one

104
00:05:47,380 --> 00:05:47,980
that's not loud enough,

105
00:05:49,020 --> 00:05:50,120
such beautiful hands,

106
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:52,820
it would be a shame if they were gone.

107
00:05:57,320 --> 00:05:58,600
If you have any complaints about me,

108
00:05:59,380 --> 00:06:01,100
I'm open to a frank discussion.

109
00:06:01,760 --> 00:06:03,180
If I hear you

110
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:05,360
talking nonsense behind my back again,

111
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:06,960
you'd better watch your tongue.

112
00:06:07,660 --> 00:06:08,720
Mom, try this.

113
00:06:08,960 --> 00:06:09,740
Shrimp with green beans.

114
00:06:09,980 --> 00:06:11,640
I specially asked the kitchen to make it for you.

115
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:12,460
Try it.

116
00:06:12,860 --> 00:06:13,780
You too.

117
00:06:14,560 --> 00:06:15,120
Madam.

118
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:16,620
Madam.

119
00:06:17,240 --> 00:06:18,140
You are kind and generous.

120
00:06:18,660 --> 00:06:20,160
You must help Doukou.

121
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:21,720
What happened?

122
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:23,240
Doukou

123
00:06:24,340 --> 00:06:25,320
threw herself into the well.

124
00:06:25,400 --> 00:06:26,000
What?

125
00:06:26,780 --> 00:06:28,180
She was forced to do that by the Young Madam.

126
00:06:28,460 --> 00:06:29,560
How could she do that?

127
00:06:30,260 --> 00:06:31,780
Amitabha Buddha.

128
00:06:40,860 --> 00:06:41,760
Su Muwan,

129
00:06:42,400 --> 00:06:43,460
Willow said

130
00:06:44,140 --> 00:06:46,040
you beat Doukou for no reason.

131
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:47,520
Not only did you beat her face swollen,

132
00:06:47,700 --> 00:06:49,360
but also forced her to throw into the well.

133
00:06:49,560 --> 00:06:50,840
What happened?

134
00:06:51,740 --> 00:06:52,420
Young Madam

135
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:55,260
was dissatisfied with Miss Ye's coming to the mansion.

136
00:06:55,820 --> 00:06:56,960
So she took it out on us servants.

137
00:06:57,560 --> 00:06:58,460
Yesterday in the living room,

138
00:06:58,720 --> 00:07:00,600
Doukou just bumped into her by accident.

139
00:07:00,880 --> 00:07:02,620
She forced me to slap Doukou.

140
00:07:03,180 --> 00:07:03,740
She also said that

141
00:07:04,320 --> 00:07:05,300
if I didn't slap hard enough,

142
00:07:05,400 --> 00:07:06,320
she would break my hand.

143
00:07:06,620 --> 00:07:08,180
Doukou felt humiliated,

144
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:09,380
and in despair,

145
00:07:09,580 --> 00:07:10,500
she jumped into the well.

146
00:07:11,460 --> 00:07:12,000
Willow,

147
00:07:12,820 --> 00:07:14,120
you're really good at making things up.

148
00:07:14,420 --> 00:07:16,100
Doukou is already dead,

149
00:07:16,220 --> 00:07:17,140
and there's no one to prove it.

150
00:07:17,740 --> 00:07:19,620
Young Madam can say whatever

151
00:07:19,900 --> 00:07:20,700
she wants now.

152
00:07:20,700 --> 00:07:20,980
Nonsense!

153
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:27,160
My sister would never do such a thing.

154
00:07:27,420 --> 00:07:27,960
Madam,

155
00:07:28,180 --> 00:07:28,960
please don't believe her.

156
00:07:29,320 --> 00:07:30,300
Cardamom

157
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:31,420
is naturally impetuous.

158
00:07:31,740 --> 00:07:32,320
Maybe

159
00:07:32,460 --> 00:07:34,160
she accidentally fell into the well herself.

160
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:35,520
Don't misunderstand her.

161
00:07:36,300 --> 00:07:36,640
Humph.

162
00:07:37,340 --> 00:07:37,900
Misunderstand?

163
00:07:38,220 --> 00:07:40,360
Su Muwan has always been lawless.

164
00:07:40,550 --> 00:07:42,130
It's not surprising that she did this.

165
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:43,380
There are laws in the country,

166
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:44,400
and rules in the family.

167
00:07:44,860 --> 00:07:45,220
Fuyuan.

168
00:07:45,960 --> 00:07:46,300
Yes, Madam.

169
00:07:46,700 --> 00:07:48,500
Did Young Madam really mistreat the servant

170
00:07:49,020 --> 00:07:50,120
and force her to throw herself into the well?

171
00:07:50,740 --> 00:07:51,840
Then do as she did.

172
00:07:52,160 --> 00:07:53,420
Force her to kneel in the garden,

173
00:07:53,820 --> 00:07:55,200
and slap her face.

174
00:07:56,280 --> 00:07:56,800
Madam,

175
00:07:57,440 --> 00:07:58,900
if this gets out,

176
00:07:59,420 --> 00:08:01,660
it will be known that she killed a servant.

177
00:08:03,420 --> 00:08:04,980
It will affect the reputation of the Ling Family.

178
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:05,820
Reputation?

179
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:10,200
She did such a thing.

180
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:12,640
Not to mention slapping her,

181
00:08:13,140 --> 00:08:15,120
it's not too much to kick her out of the Ling Family.

182
00:08:15,500 --> 00:08:16,460
Our Ling Family

183
00:08:16,620 --> 00:08:19,420
will never tolerate such a cruel daughter-in-law.

184
00:08:21,980 --> 00:08:22,820
Don't.

185
00:08:22,940 --> 00:08:23,380
Mom.

186
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:24,880
This matter

187
00:08:26,220 --> 00:08:27,380
might not be true.

188
00:08:29,940 --> 00:08:30,860
How about this?

189
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:32,360
Young Madam,

190
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:35,600
go apologize to Doukou's family now.

191
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:36,760
We'll

192
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:39,680
pretend it never happened,

193
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:43,200
and save our family's reputation.

194
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:47,500
This isn't over.

195
00:08:48,260 --> 00:08:49,980
You can't just pin this on me.

196
00:08:50,520 --> 00:08:51,020
Don't you even think about it.

197
00:08:53,340 --> 00:08:53,820
Madam,

198
00:08:54,900 --> 00:08:55,740
may I have a word

199
00:08:56,200 --> 00:08:57,320
with Willow?

200
00:08:58,200 --> 00:08:58,560
Go ahead.

201
00:09:01,100 --> 00:09:02,080
You said Doukou bumped into me

202
00:09:02,560 --> 00:09:03,520
and you were ordered to slap her.

203
00:09:03,980 --> 00:09:04,640
I admit it.

204
00:09:05,100 --> 00:09:06,160
But I remember

205
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:07,200
it wasn't in the living room,

206
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:08,520
but in the garden.

207
00:09:10,580 --> 00:09:11,200
Yes,

208
00:09:11,620 --> 00:09:12,400
it was in the garden.

209
00:09:12,780 --> 00:09:13,480
Yesterday,

210
00:09:13,900 --> 00:09:15,580
under the magnolia tree in the garden,

211
00:09:16,300 --> 00:09:17,340
Doukou bumped into you.

212
00:09:17,680 --> 00:09:18,020
Oh.

213
00:09:19,100 --> 00:09:20,380
Yesterday, the Young Marshal invited guests,

214
00:09:20,460 --> 00:09:21,820
and ordered servants not to wander around.

215
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:23,780
Why were you and Doukou in the garden?

216
00:09:26,100 --> 00:09:26,500
No.

217
00:09:26,700 --> 00:09:27,000
No.

218
00:09:27,260 --> 00:09:28,180
I didn't go to the garden.

219
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:30,360
So where did this happen,

220
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:31,160
the living room or the garden?

221
00:09:32,820 --> 00:09:33,000
I...

222
00:09:33,180 --> 00:09:33,560
I...

223
00:09:33,640 --> 00:09:34,040
Madam,

224
00:09:34,780 --> 00:09:35,700
it's pretty clear.

225
00:09:36,560 --> 00:09:37,980
She spread rumors about me,

226
00:09:38,100 --> 00:09:38,960
so I punished her.

227
00:09:39,740 --> 00:09:40,740
But to frame me

228
00:09:40,760 --> 00:09:41,720
for her death,

229
00:09:42,200 --> 00:09:42,720
I won't admit it.

230
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:44,900
But

231
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:46,120
where is Doukou's body?

232
00:09:46,540 --> 00:09:48,300
Since you keep saying

233
00:09:48,400 --> 00:09:49,720
Doukou jumped into the well,

234
00:09:50,780 --> 00:09:53,160
there must be corresponding marks on her body.

235
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:55,240
We can find out by examining the body.

236
00:09:55,740 --> 00:09:56,200
Sister,

237
00:09:56,900 --> 00:09:57,700
you're too brazen.

238
00:09:58,100 --> 00:09:59,380
The Old Madam eats vegetarian and recites the Buddha's name.

239
00:10:00,300 --> 00:10:01,520
How can you let the Buddha

240
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:03,020
see

241
00:10:03,020 --> 00:10:03,380
such

242
00:10:03,540 --> 00:10:04,660
impure things?

243
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:06,900
Buddha is merciful,

244
00:10:07,340 --> 00:10:08,080
and will clear our names.

245
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:08,760
He will surely

246
00:10:09,240 --> 00:10:10,200
agree to this.

247
00:10:10,400 --> 00:10:11,140
How dare you!

248
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:12,860
Autopsy, huh?

249
00:10:13,380 --> 00:10:14,300
Alright, Young Madam.

250
00:10:14,680 --> 00:10:15,300
Tell me,

251
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:16,920
how do you want to proceed?

252
00:10:17,680 --> 00:10:18,540
A drowning victim

253
00:10:19,060 --> 00:10:20,320
would have significant water in their lungs,

254
00:10:20,900 --> 00:10:22,420
but if the body was dumped,

255
00:10:22,800 --> 00:10:23,920
there wouldn't be any water in the lungs.

256
00:10:24,400 --> 00:10:24,960
Additionally,

257
00:10:25,280 --> 00:10:27,420
struggles would leave marks on the body.

258
00:10:27,520 --> 00:10:27,860
Likewise,

259
00:10:27,860 --> 00:10:28,840
the perpetrator would likely

260
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:30,180
sustain injuries during the struggle.

261
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:30,800
So,

262
00:10:30,800 --> 00:10:32,420
why not check for any

263
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:33,480
unexplained injuries among the servants?

264
00:10:33,820 --> 00:10:34,600
That would reveal the truth, wouldn't it?
